OL,3,GNEWSAMedal of hero killed in last week
OL,4,Aof WW1 auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victoria Cross awarded to a soldier
OL,7,Fwho was killed while defending comrades
OL,8,Fin the last week of World War One is
OL,9,Fbeing put up for auction.
OL,11,FJames Kirk, from Cheadle Hulme, Greater
OL,12,FManchester, died under heavy machine
OL,13,Fgun fire as he protected soldiers
OL,14,Fbuilding a bridge in France in November
OL,15,F1918.
OL,17,FThe 21-year-old second lieutenant
OL,18,Fcarried on fighting even after being
OL,19,Fshot in the face, having paddled across
OL,20,Fa canal to single-handedly confront
OL,21,FGerman gunners.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
