OL,3,GNEWSAMedal of hero killed in last week
OL,4,Aof WW1 auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis medal is being sold by London
OL,7,Fauctioneers Noonans on 7 October and is
OL,8,Fexpected to fetch between #100,000 and
OL,9,F#160,000.
